Operationalizing Threat Feeds
Overview
Threat feeds provide continuously updated information about known or suspected malicious activity.
Common indicators include:
Malicious IP addresses
Malicious domains
URLs
File hashes
Malware indicators
Phishing infrastructure
Botnet infrastructure
Known attacker infrastructure
Operationalizing threat feeds means converting raw threat intelligence into actionable detections, alerts, security controls, investigations, and response actions.
